            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi definisi kolom untuk sintaks pembuatan tabel <code>Directory</code> dengan tipe data kolom yang sesuai.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" companyName \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"REAL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"BOOLEAN\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>INTEGER</code>, diikuti oleh <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Deklarasikan floors bilangan bulat, nama company berupa teks, dan ratings desimal dalam tabel <code>Directory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"companyName\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rating\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"REAL\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"BOOLEAN\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"NULL\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>INTEGER</code>, diikuti oleh <code>TEXT</code>, dan terakhir <code>REAL</code>.</p></body></html>",
